IF WE FAIL TO REMAIN QUALIFIED AS A REIT, OUR DISTRIBUTIONS WILL NOT BE
DEDUCTIBLE BY US, AND OUR INCOME WILL BE SUBJECT TO TAXATION, REDUCING OUR
